  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your Vestige Companion keeps growing in strength, and with your help it can briefly adopt a more powerful form. While the vestige is within 90 feet of you, you can take a Magic action to shape-shift it for 1 hour, depending on its type, into a Celestial Spirit (Celestial vestige; see @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.jivWkxHu2huBXV0U]{Summon Celestial}), a Fiendish Spirit (Fiend vestige; see @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.veN6IiVn4zwHM7r9]{Summon Fiend}), or an Undead Spirit (Undead vestige; see @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.EX24QkNdCeUOAeeV]{Summon Undead}). The vestige's game statistics are replaced by the spirit's stat block, with a spell level equal to half your Warlock level (round down; maximum level 9), but it keeps its personality, Divine Power Bonus Action, Hit Points, and Hit Point Dice.</p><p>The vestige gains Temporary Hit Points equal to the Hit Points of the spirit form. Any that remain after 1 hour vanish, and the transformation ends early if it has no Temporary Hit Points left. Once you use this feature, you can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-dEgNmmUOxOBSEL0Y\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Summon the spirit of the matching spell at the level shown, then give it the vestige's Hit Points as Temporary Hit Points equal to the spirit's Hit Points.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
